      "node_id": "ifc:resolution-api",
      "properties": {
        "auth": "unspecified",
        "designation": "published",
        "medium": "library",
        "name": "EntityResolver API",
        "paradigm": "synchronous",
        "payload_format": "unspecified",
        "provenance": "inferred",
        "spec": "resolve / resolve_sourced. The source-aware path is the recommended entry point: auto-merge is reserved for name-to-name evidence, alias-sourced matches always require vector corroboration, and an incoming alias matching two or more candidates is excluded rather than guessed at.",
